# The pattern brush painting bricks; then the pattern browser.
spawn
wait "Welcome" 10s
keys esc
wait idle
keys w
wait "bricks"
keys = =
drag 4 4 60 4
drag 10 9 70 9
drag 4 14 50 14
mouse move 80 30
wait idle
shot patterns
keys ctrl-k
wait "Commands"
type Patterns
keys enter
wait idle
shot pattern-browser
